	TAD CHECK
	DCA DISPOF
	JMP I ANADIG
POS,	ISZ DISPOF	/DECREASE DISPOF
	JMP I ANADIG
	STA
	DCA DISPOF	/NO CHANGE
	JMP I ANADIG
